window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/hpc-v27-011-0edfcca3341a842a.json"]={sha256:"0edfcca3341a842a7c21de21fb0120f37b8d2660513d7dcead67f7f4adbc25a7",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v27-case-d2695308610b7d71","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/numa_memory_policy.html","title":"NUMA Memory Policy","titleEn":"NUMA Memory Policy","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-011","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"hpc-v27-011","related":[{"id":"hpc-v27-012","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/transhuge.html"],"title":"Transparent Huge Pages：稀疏觸碰的配置放大","titleEn":"Transparent Huge Pages: allocation amplification from sparse touches","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付三集合表、既存頁面對照、空交集測例與 128/64 GiB 證明；只需離線 JSON，不更改主機政策；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the three-set audit, existing-page comparison, empty-intersection case and 128/64 GiB proof. The exercise operates on local JSON fixtures and never changes the host’s actual NUMA policy. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入頁面位移表，計算 region_id=floor(offset/2MiB)，去重後列出每區塊有用與未使用位元組。","differenceEn":"Read page offsets, compute region identifiers with integer division and deduplicate them. Emit useful and unused bytes for each region so sparse allocation is visible before calculating a global amplification ratio.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["對本課明定的非空 bind 集合，候選節點取政策與允許集合交集；容量再對交集求和。空交集需單獨處理，不能推定任何核心版本的 fallback；政策集合 {0,1,2}；名義允許 {1,2,3}，變更 {2,3}；各候選節點可用容量皆為 64 GiB；名義式 2*64 = 128 GiB；變更式 1*64 = 64 GiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","在強制成功配置 2 MiB 區塊的教學模型中，實體量為被觸碰的不同區塊數乘 2 MiB；頁面實際政策需另外觀察；每個基本頁 4 KiB，65 次各觸碰一頁；名義分散在 65 個 2 MiB 區塊，變更連續放進同一區塊；名義式 65*2 = 130 MiB；變更式 ceil(65*4/2048)*2 = 2 MiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For this fixture’s nonempty bind intersection, eligible nodes are those permitted by both sets. Sum their available capacities; treat an empty intersection separately rather than inventing version-independent kernel fallback semantics. Set requested nodes to {0,1,2}. Allowed nodes change from {1,2,3} to {2,3}; each eligible node has 64 GiB of available capacity. All capacities are synthetic snapshots, not reserved guarantees. Nominal 2*64 = 128 GiB; changed 1*64 = 64 GiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","In the deliberately idealized model where every touched region receives one 2 MiB allocation, footprint is distinct touched regions times 2 MiB. Real allocation policy, collapse and splitting require separate observations. Use sixty-five 4 KiB touches. Initially each lies in a different 2 MiB region; after relocation all sixty-five occupy consecutive pages in one region. Requested useful bytes remain 260 KiB. Nominal 65*2 = 130 MiB; changed ceil(65*4/2048)*2 = 2 MiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"hpc-v27-021","referenceUrls":["https://docs.kernel.org/networking/statistics.html"],"title":"Linux 網路計數器：回繞、重置與取樣時間","titleEn":"Linux network counters: wraparound, resets and sample duration","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付三集合表、既存頁面對照、空交集測例與 128/64 GiB 證明；只需離線 JSON，不更改主機政策；請同學只使用交付件重算兩組，保留失敗案例與限制；全程使用合成檔案，不對生產系統執行故障。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Deliver the three-set audit, existing-page comparison, empty-intersection case and 128/64 GiB proof. The exercise operates on local JSON fixtures and never changes the host’s actual NUMA policy. Have a peer reproduce both configurations from the artifacts, retaining failed cases and limitations. Use synthetic files throughout; never inject these faults into a production system.","difference":"輸入 timestamp、counter、bits、epoch、wraps_known；輸出 delta、rate 與 validity，不把重啟樣本填成零。","differenceEn":"Input timestamp, counter, bits, epoch and wraps_known fields. Emit delta, rate and validity separately, preserving invalid intervals instead of replacing reset observations with misleading zero traffic.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["對本課明定的非空 bind 集合，候選節點取政策與允許集合交集；容量再對交集求和。空交集需單獨處理，不能推定任何核心版本的 fallback；政策集合 {0,1,2}；名義允許 {1,2,3}，變更 {2,3}；各候選節點可用容量皆為 64 GiB；名義式 2*64 = 128 GiB；變更式 1*64 = 64 GiB。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","在確認恰好一次回繞的固定寬度模型中，差值為 modulus-old+new；速率再除以真實時間差；教學 16-bit 計數器由 65000 到 1000，epoch 相同且已確認一次回繞；時間差由 2 改為 4 秒；名義式 (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s；變更式 (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s。所有數值、限制與門檻為原創合成教學條件；來源支援概念與介面，不代表實機量測或設備規格。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["For this fixture’s nonempty bind intersection, eligible nodes are those permitted by both sets. Sum their available capacities; treat an empty intersection separately rather than inventing version-independent kernel fallback semantics. Set requested nodes to {0,1,2}. Allowed nodes change from {1,2,3} to {2,3}; each eligible node has 64 GiB of available capacity. All capacities are synthetic snapshots, not reserved guarantees. Nominal 2*64 = 128 GiB; changed 1*64 = 64 GiB. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","With exactly one confirmed wrap in a fixed-width counter, delta is modulus minus old plus new. Divide by the actual elapsed duration; multiple wraps cannot be inferred from only two samples. A synthetic 16-bit byte counter moves from 65000 to 1000 in the same epoch, with one wrap explicitly confirmed. Elapsed time changes from 2 to 4 seconds; these are not Linux’s native counter-width claims. Nominal (65536-65000+1000)/2 = 768 B/s; changed (65536-65000+1000)/4 = 384 B/s. Every numeric input, limit and threshold is an original synthetic teaching condition. References establish concepts and interfaces, not measured machine results or equipment specifications.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v27-case-2ba59bdc35375ccb","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/admin-guide/mm/transhuge.html","title":"Transparent Hugepage Support","titleEn":"Transparent Hugepage Support","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v27-case-067b923c66f4ac46","url":"https://docs.kernel.org/networking/statistics.html","title":"Interface statistics","titleEn":"Interface statistics","publisher":"Linux kernel project","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
